# Execution Modes (Token-Aware Quality)

> Outcomes per token — not cheapest AI. Spec: `kesh-agent-spec.mdc`. Router: `kesh-runtime-router.mdc`.

## Modes

| Mode | When | Delegation |
|------|------|------------|
| **FAST** | Simple explanations; isolated low-risk tasks | Minimal; deterministic checks if code touched |
| **STANDARD** | Normal features, fixes, refactors, reviews | Implement + test + specialized independent review |
| **CRITICAL** | Security, database, distributed, consequential prod-bound | Architecture as needed + implement + test + independent review + warranted gates |
| **INCIDENT_ARCHITECTURE** | Production incidents; major system changes | Full **applicable** specialists + independent validation |

## Default mapping (`task_class` → mode)

| task_class | Default mode |
|------------|--------------|
| EXPLANATION | FAST |
| INVESTIGATION (read-only) | FAST |
| DEBUGGING / PATCH / BUG_FIX / FEATURE / REFACTOR / CODE_REVIEW | STANDARD |
| DATABASE_CHANGE / SECURITY_CHANGE | CRITICAL |
| ARCHITECTURE (material) / PRODUCTION_INCIDENT | INCIDENT_ARCHITECTURE |

## Risk signals → escalate (never for cost alone)

Escalate at least one level when any apply:

- Auth, secrets, PII, payment, multi-tenant isolation  
- Schema / migration / data backfill  
- Distributed consistency, exactly-once, cross-service contracts  
- Production mutation or incident  
- Ambiguous requirements with high blast radius  

**Forbidden:** downgrade CRITICAL → STANDARD (or lower) only to save tokens.

## Mode vs quality

| Mode | May skip | Must not skip |
|------|----------|---------------|
| FAST | Multi-agent ceremony, optional gates | Honesty if code/security risk appears → escalate |
| STANDARD | Full org harvest if no footprint; optional Money Lens on tiny patches | Tests when code changes; Bhishma on shipped code |
| CRITICAL | Irrelevant language standards | Security/DB standards; independent review; deterministic verification |
| INCIDENT_ARCHITECTURE | Slow org digressions during active fire | Evidence-first; approval for consequential acts; validation before COMPLETE |

CLI helper: `python3 scripts/modes/select_mode.py --task-class FEATURE --signals security,schema`
